            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. synchronized: the monitor",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Mutual exclusion==: one thread holds the object's **monitor**",
                "==Visibility==: unlock publishes writes to the next acquirer",
                "Prefer a `private final` lock object over `this`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Form",
                "Locks"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Instance method",
                  "`this`"
                ],
                [
                  "Static method",
                  "the `Class` object"
                ],
                [
                  "Block",
                  "any object you pick"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. volatile",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Visibility== and ordering (**happens-before**), not atomicity",
                "`volatile int count; count++` is read, add, write: still a {red:race}"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Need",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Stop flag, immutable reference",
                  "`volatile`"
                ],
                [
                  "Check-then-act, compound update",
                  "`synchronized`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. wait / notify",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Call only while holding the monitor, else `IllegalMonitorStateException`",
                "`wait` sits in a ==while== loop: spurious wakeups"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "synchronized (lock) {",
                "    while (!ready) lock.wait();",
                "}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Happens-before?** A JMM ordering edge: if A happens-before B, A's writes are visible to B (unlock to lock, volatile write to read, start, join)",
                "**volatile count++ unsafe?** Three steps; threads interleave",
                "**Static synchronized locks?** The Class object",
                "**while, not if?** Recheck the condition after waking"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
