              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. ConcurrentHashMap",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Lock-free reads; writes lock one ==bin==, CAS on empty bins",
                "{red:No null} keys or values",
                "Use atomic `putIfAbsent`, `computeIfAbsent`, `merge`",
                "**get** then **put** on separate calls = {red:race}"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "counts.merge(word, 1, Integer::sum);"
              ]
            },
