    {
      "title": "Concurrency Pitfalls and Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Concurrency Pitfalls and Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Races and Deadlock",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{red:Race}: unsynchronized check-then-act or read-modify-write",
                "Fix: ==atomics==, ==locks== or concurrent collections",
                "{red:Deadlock} needs ==circular wait== on locks",
                "Prevent: fixed global lock order, or `tryLock` with timeout"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Interrupts and Confinement",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Never swallow `InterruptedException`: ==restore the flag== or rethrow"
              ],
              "style": "cross"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "try {",
                "    task = queue.take();",
                "} catch (InterruptedException e) {",
                "    Thread.currentThread().interrupt();",
                "    return;",
                "}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Prefer ==immutability== and thread confinement",
                "`ThreadLocal` sparingly; `remove()` in pooled threads or it leaks"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Cheat Sheet",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
